-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",298,{
[9505]="70030868\n1\tDefeat Mordor Overseers (total: 3)\tNîn-stazg can be found south-east of Floodwend, just out of sight of the town's walls. You should defeat Mordor Orc-overseers at Nîn-stazg.\n2\tReturn to Radwig outside of Nîn-stazg\tThane Radwig stands on a hill overlooking Nîn-stazg. You should speak with Radwig.\n",
[9506]="7001BFA4\n1\tDefeat Tarkrîp Orcs in Iorvinas (total: 6)\030Defeat Dourhand Dwarves in Iorvinas (total: 6)\tDourhands and Orcs can be found within the halls of Iorvinas. Logi has asked you to bring an end to the alliance of the Dourhands and Orcs.\n2\tTalk to Logi\tLogi is at the entrance to the ruins of Iorvinas. Many of the Dourhands and Orcs were seen in close proximity. It is clear that Logi is right, the Orcs and Dourhands are in league. He should be told of this.\n",
[9507]="7001F3C2\n1\tDefeat half-orcs in the north-east hills (total: 5)\030Defeat Orcs in the north-east hills (total: 5)\tMake your way to the ruins north of the hunter's encampment and defeat the Orcs and half-orcs you find there. Sam Thistlebur directed you to make your way to the north to fight and slay the Orcs and half-orcs in the ruins there.\n2\tTalk to Sam Thistlebur at his camp\tReturn to Sam at his encampment south of the camp where you fought and defeated the Orcs and half-orcs of the White Hand. Sam is waiting for your return. It is certain that he will be pleased with all that you have accomplished.\n",
[9508]="700303D0\n1\tDefeat White Hand warriors (total: 10)\tWhite Hand warriors can be found in Fangorn near their encampment. You should defeat White Hand warriors in Fangorn.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs in Fangorn to avenge the burned and felled trees of his grove.\n",
[9509]="700303EC\n1\tDefeat Orcs at the White Hand encampment with the Huorn's help (total: 12)\tOrcs are at the White Hand Encampment at the north-east edge of Fangorn's eaves. You should crush the Orcs with the help of the vengeful Huorn who has begun to follow your lead.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs in a tough little encampment at the edge of Fangorn's eaves.\n",
[9510]="7005A658\n1\tDefeat bat-rider sentries in Máttugard (total: 5)\tBat-rider sentries can be found south-west of Búshatap in Máttugard. You should defeat any bat-rider sentries that you find.\n2\tLocate Tholmuzog\tTholmuzog can be found north-west of Búshatap in Máttugard. You should locate Tholmuzog.\n3\tDefeat Orcs at Tholmuzog (total: 10)\030Defeat trolls at Tholmuzog (total: 6)\030Collect Orc-orders at Tholmuzog (total: 8)\tTholmuzog can be found north-west of Búshatap in Máttugard. You should defeat Orcs and trolls at Tholmuzog and discover what they plan to do in Máttugard.\n4\tBring the Orc-orders to Hetbrúda near Tholmuzog\tHetbrúda can be found near Tholmuzog. You should bring the Orc-orders to Hetbrúda.\n",
[9511]="70026E6C\n1\tDefeat Orc grunts (total: 5)\030Defeat Orc guards (total: 4)\tOrcs can be found throughout the northern part of the Heathfells. Captain Cadfrith has asked you to defeat the bands of Orcs that have crept into the northern Heathfells and discover where they are coming from.\n2\tTalk to Cadfrith at the Rohirrim encampment\tCaptain Cadfrith is at the Rohirrim encampment in the north-west Heathfells. You should return to Captain Cadfrith with your report.\n",
[9512]="70041375\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Dead Marshes (total: 15)\tThere are Orcs hunting for something. It would surely be better if they failed in their search. You should defeat a number of Orcs in the Dead Marshes, to hinder their progress.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Orcs in the Dead Marshes.\n",
[9513]="70002CD0\n1\tDefeat Blogmal fighters (total: 5)\030Defeat Blogmal skirmishers (total: 5)\tThere are Blogmal Orcs in the south-east part of the Ram Dúath. The Tuokki, the Earth-kin elder leading the Suuri-lehmä tribe while their chieftain is away south in the North Downs, has asked you to help drive the Blogmal Orcs from Ram Dúath.\n2\tTalk to Chief Tuokki\tChief Tuokki is at the Suuri-lehmä camp in Ram Dúath. You should return to Chief Tuokki and tell him of your victory against the Orcs of the Blogmal tribe.\n",
[9514]="7002EF1A\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Thornhope (total: 6)\tOrcs may be found within the ruins of Thornhope in the Entwash Vale. You should defeat as many Orcs as you can to help satisfy Béortnoth's desire for revenge.\n",
[9515]="7000173F\n1\tDefeat Ongbúrz Combatant (total: 16)\030Defeat Ongbúrz Man-slayer (total: 12)\030Defeat Ongbúrz Battle-master (total: 6)\tThe strongest warriors of the Ongbúrz tribe can be found patrolling the deep trenches of Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín. You should defeat the strongest of the Ongbúrz in Dol Dínen.\n2\tTell Elúr of your victory\tElúr is at his encampment south-east of Esteldín. You should tell Elúr of your victory against the Orcs of Dol Dínen.\n",
[9516]="70071B43\n1\tTBD Return to quest giver\tTBD Return to Quest Bestower\n",
[9517]="7005B18B\n1\tDefeat the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog\tUfúrzrak Orcs and thrug-hai can be found at Muru Azog, before the East-gate of Nud-mekhem at Azanulbizar. You should defeat the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.\n2\tDefeat Ufúrzrak Orcs at Muru Azog (total: 10)\030Defeat Ufúrzrak thrug-hai at Muru Azog (total: 4)\tUfúrzrak Orcs and thrug-hai can be found at Muru Azog, before the East-gate of Nud-mekhem at Azanulbizar. You should defeat the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.\n",
[9518]="700155CA\n1\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Orcs\tGhâsh-hai Orcs can be found in Ânghumu-ru, in the north-west quadrant of the Flaming Deeps. These fire-loving enemy forces should be defeated.\n2\tDefeat Ghâsh-hai Orcs in Ânghumu-ru (total: 8)\tGhâsh-hai Orcs can be found in Ânghumu-ru, in the north-west quadrant of the Flaming Deeps. These fire-loving enemy forces should be defeated.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Orcs at Ânghumu-ru, sapping the strength of their armies and assuring that they will pose less of a threat to the dwarves of the Flaming Deeps.\n",
[9519]="7003505C\n1\tDefeat Balewood warriors (total: 6)\030Defeat Balewood path-finders (total: 4)\tThe Orcs of the Balewood are a mighty force and their numbers must be thinned if the Rohirrim of Wildermore are to seize the advantage.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs in the Balewood.\n",
[9520]="7000C37E\n1\tTalk to Glóin at his camp outside Goblin-town\030Search for orders among the goblins in Goblin-town\tThe main entrance to Goblin-town is just to the north-east of Glóin's camp in the Northern High Pass. Glóin believes that there may be something afoot within Goblin-town and bade you return to its halls in search of evidence exposing the reason behind the muster of the goblin-forces.\n",
[9521]="70028C6E\n1\tBring the note to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, south and east of Cadthorn's position. You should bring the note you recovered to Ardwyn.\n",
[9522]="70043DFF\n1\tBring the orders to Khúrhosh quickly\tKhúrhosh is at the Eastern Wharf. Bring the orders to Khúrhosh. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9523]="7005465F\n1\tFind a position from which you might overhear the conversation of the Orcs\tDolenthol has asked you to find good vantage points throughout the Orc encampment from which you might listen to Orkish conversation and learn the reason they do not fight each other.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tReturn to Dolenthol and inform him about the conversation you overheard from Gothmog's forces.\n",
[9524]="70047AE1\n1\tCollect Orders from Mordor in the Towers of the Teeth\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should intercept more orders from Uruks and Black Númenóreans within the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tCollect orders from Uruks or Black Númenóreans (total: 6)\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should intercept more orders from Uruks and Black Númenóreans within the Towers of the Teeth.\n3\tBring the orders to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills. You should show the orders to Thurindol.\n",
[9525]="70040FB7\n1\tCollect orders from Corsair spies (total: 3)\tCorsair spies can be found lurking north of Ost Lontir, especially off of the roads and near the Ringló. Gilanor has asked you to seek out Corsair spies and recover any order they may be carrying.\n2\tDeliver the orders to Gilanor\tGilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have recovered a collection of orders detailing the leadership and intent of the Corsairs in Edhellond. You should report back to Gilanor.\n",
[9526]="7006C537\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Ab-dâna (total: 12)\030Recover Orc orders (total: 10)\tYour mission is to travel to Ab-dâna and eliminate Orcs you find there to recover any orders they have so that Ashâmi can discover who is sending them.\n",
[9527]="7004A8CD\n1\tOrcs can be found throughout Cirith Ungol. Captain Róglarg has commanded you to gather eight Orcs to be sacrificed to Shelob.\t\n2\tReport to Captain Róglarg in Cirith Ungol\tCaptain Róglarg can be found in the courtyard of Cirith Ungol. You have gathered the sacrifices and should now report back to Captain Róglarg.\n",
[9528]="70026731\n1\tCollect orders from the Angmarim leader at Haudh Eldacar\tHaudh Eldacar is to the south-west of the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam asked you to obtain orders from the commander at Haudh Eldacar.\n2\tBring the orders to Rodlam in the Way of Kings\tRodlam is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam will be eager to begin deciphering the orders you found.\n",
[9529]="7004AB9B\n1\tComplete Durthang: Order of the Pit\tCandúr can be found in Udûn. You should talk Candúr.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted Durthang: Order of the Pit.\n",
[9530]="7005403A\n1\tIntercept Enemy orders (total: 10)\tOrders might drop from many enemies found throughout Parth Daenath. You should intercept Enemy orders for Amroth.\n2\tBring the Enemy's orders to Amroth\tAmroth can be found at Echad-in-Edhil. You should bring the Enemy orders to Amroth.\n",
[9531]="700372CF\n1\tTalk to Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Thane Ordlac asked you to return to Reeve Fríthild and tell her that he is prepared for a council.\n",
[9532]="70032BD7\n1\tRecover ore from White-hand Orcs (total: 3)\030Recover ore from Moria Orcs (total: 3)\tOre is being gathered by both tribes of Orcs in large quantities in the central area of the large Redhorn Lodes cavern.\n2\tReturn to Róarr\tBring the ore samples back to Róarr, camped at the bottom of the stairs on the way up to Orc-watch.\n",
[9533]="7002D52F\n1\tHarvest ore-samples near the Deep Descent camp (total: 8)\tOre veins can be found in the vicinity of the Deep Descent camp, and down into the passage reaching towards the Silvertine mines. You should mine small ore veins in search for traces of mithril.\n2\tBring the ore you collected to Styrr\tStyrr is at the Deep Descent camp in the Silvertine Lodes. You should bring the ore you collected to Styrr in the Deep Descent.\n",
[9534]="7002D533\n1\tHarvest ore from deposits in the mine-shaft (total: 8)\tOre deposits can be found in the glow-worm infested mine-shaft near Sori. You should collect ore from the deposits so that Sori may assess the likelihood of mithril being found in this area.\n2\tBring the ore samples to Sori\tSori is on a platform in the southern tunnels of the Silvertine Lodes. You should return to Sori with the ore you collected.\n",
[9535]="7002D536\n1\tHarvest ore from deposits in the southern tunnel (total: 8)\tOre-deposits can be found in the tunnel near Sori, and in the south-heading passage of the Silvertine Lodes. You should search nearby for deposits of ore, and bring samples back to Sori for inspection.\n2\tBring the ore to Sori\tSori is in the southern tunnel of the Silvertine Lodes, perched on a wooden platform. You should bring the ore you gathered to Sori so that he may inspect it for mithril.\n",
[9536]="7002D551\n1\tHarvest ore from mineral deposits (total: 8)\tOre deposits can be found along the rock-walls of the Old Silvertine City in the southern Silvertine Lodes. You should collect ore from the mineral deposits along the walls.\n2\tBring the samples you collected to Öndótt\tÖndótt is at the top of the stair in the Old Silvertine City. You should bring the samples you gathered to Öndótt.\n",
})
